# Source and working material, never deploy these publicly
content/
.cursor/
*.docx
*.pdf
*.md
ai-design-workflow-system.md
scratchpad/
explorations/

# The pharmacy dispenses skill files and they are Markdown, which *.md
# above would exclude from the deploy. Negated here, after it, so the
# order resolves: without this every Take one link 404s in production
# while the local build looks perfectly fine.
!skills/*.md

# Ask Rish reads api/brain.md off disk at runtime, and *.md above would
# keep it out of the deploy. Same negation, same reason as skills/*.md:
# without this line the function answers every question with "that's not
# in my notes" in production while working perfectly on this machine.
!api/brain.md
